1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,600
(Amy:)I'm regretting
my earlier cattiness.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,370
(Amy:)She is an
absolute delight.

3
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:11,660
(Leonard:)Wow.

4
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:19,080
(Howard:)Wow, indeed.

5
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,420
(Bernadette:)I can't believe we're
finally living together.

6
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,020
(Howard:)Yeah.

7
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,860
(Howard:)You know what would make
this moment perfect?

8
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,020
(Bernadette:)What?

9
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:30,230
(Howard:)A little snack.
You got any string cheese?

10
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:31,960
(Bernadette:)No.

11
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,660
I-I might have some cheddar.

12
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,530
(Howard:)Not as good.

13
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:38,270
(Howard:)You can't make strings with it.

14
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:40,400
(Howard:)Remind me to put it
on your shopping list.

15
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,710
(Howard:)Okay.

16
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:44,440
(Howard:)You have
hypo-allergenic detergent?

17
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,610
(Bernadette:)No.

18
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:47,030
(Howard:)Better put it on the list.

19
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,980
(Howard:)If you wash my underwear
with regular soap,

20
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:51,510
I get little red bumps
on my tuchus.

21
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,450
(Bernadette:)Wait a second.

22
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:57,890
(Bernadette:)I'm doing your laundry?

23
00:00:57,890 --> 00:01:01,560
(Howard:)Well, honey,
it's not gonna do itself.

